        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T17:55:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It is definitely our intention to post official rulings on all of the questions people have posed on this forum! I would like to thank Andy in particular for compiling all such questions in a convenient format. Unfortunately, we have gotten *extremely* behind in responding to these questions, owing primarilly to the combined crazy-business involved in Vengeance, GSF, the warehouse move, and now the start of the convention season. However, we hope to get to them soon! Perhaps a series of giant super-long plane trips to and from Australia will help...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In any case, I just wanted to let you all know that we appreciate the questions, and will endevor to catch up with responses, and respond more promptly going forward. Stay tuned!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:38:48.356Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
