        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It is definitely our intention to post official rulings on all of the questions people have posed on this forum! I would like to thank Andy in particular for compiling all such questions in a convenient format. Unfortunately, we have gotten *extremely* behind in responding to these questions, owing primarilly to the combined crazy-business involved in Vengeance, GSF, the warehouse move, and now the start of the convention season. However, we hope to get to them soon! Perhaps a series of giant super-long plane trips to and from Australia will help...</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In any case, I just wanted to let you all know that we appreciate the questions, and will endevor to catch up with responses, and respond more promptly going forward. Stay tuned!</p>",
