      {
        "id": 67564,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T18:02:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Once you post official rulings to those questions, I'll add them to my FAQ, but do you guys have any plans for dealing with the largish set of FAQ-worthy information in general?&nbsp; By that I mean, are you planning on updating cards in a new printing with new wording that would remove the need for some of the clarifications in the FAQ, or are you planning on producing an official FAQ of your own?&nbsp; Or are you guys relatively comfortable with the way we've been handling things so far?</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:45:36.685Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
