        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Once you post official rulings to those questions, I&#39;ll add them to my FAQ, but do you guys have any plans for dealing with the largish set of FAQ-worthy information in general?&nbsp; By that I mean, are you planning on updating cards in a new printing with new wording that would remove the need for some of the clarifications in the FAQ, or are you planning on producing an official FAQ of your own?&nbsp; Or are you guys relatively comfortable with the way we&#39;ve been handling things so far?</p>",
