      {
        "id": 67565,
        "name": "Paul",
        "username": "Paul",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-07-09T19:47:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We are relativly comofortable with the way you've been handling things thus far since, while there are quite a number of \"official ruling\" clarifications, they are not generally required by players for the game to be enjoyed. However, we would love to create an official \"FAQ\" at some point, but it is below all of the items on the \"List of Thing To Do\" that involve \"Stabilizing GTG as a Real Company\" :)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In the mean time, I definitely want to thank you for all of your help compiling and sharing the answers to such questions! We really appreciate it!</p>",
